  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“I don’t know… don’t you have more to pick from?”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Entropist 1st, shuffling focus class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose two elements not in your elemental array, assigning the number 5 to one and 6 to the other. Whenever you roll for shuffling focus or reroll using your bend fate ability, roll d6s instead of d4s and apply the elements you’ve assigned to 5 or 6 for such rolls, and you can select these elements if you use bend fate to select an element without rolling. This feat does not allow you to learn wild talents outside of your array except for universal wild talents, cannot be taken if you have the narrow array feat, and must be taken at entropist level 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
